WEBVTT

00:02:58.296 --> 00:03:01.405
Shu bois hozirda faqat 
alomatlarni da'volash usullari qollanadi,

00:03:01.405 --> 00:03:03.405
kasallik sababchilarini emas.

00:03:03.405 --> 00:03:05.839
Bu usullarning biri МАТХ metodi bo'lib,

00:03:05.839 --> 00:03:09.928
to'g'ayning bo'laklaridan hujayralar 
to'planib, ulardan yangi toqima yasaladi.

00:03:09.928 --> 00:03:12.267
Boshqa bitta usul bu mikrofraktura.

00:03:12.267 --> 00:03:14.772
Hirurglar kickik teshiklar yaratib,
ular orqali

00:03:14.772 --> 00:03:19.182
suyak iligidan ildiz hujayralari 
oqib chiqib yangi to'g'ay yaratadi.

00:03:19.182 --> 00:03:20.332
Eng ohorgi chora

00:03:20.332 --> 00:03:24.832
to'g'ayi butunlay yemirilgan bemorning
toliq bo'g'imini almashtiriluvi.

00:03:24.832 --> 00:03:26.663
Ammo bu kabi keskin choralar
bo'lsa ham

00:03:26.663 --> 00:03:29.425
autoimmun artritni yaratuvchi sabablarini

00:03:29.425 --> 00:03:32.441
da'volash hali ham mushkul masaladir.